flowchart LR
  W[Working tree diff] -->|git diff| P[plain patch file]
  P --> C[git apply --check]
  C -->|pass| A[git apply<br/>files change; no commit]
  A --> R[review, stage, commit]
  H[Existing commit] -->|git format-patch| M[mailbox patch with metadata]
  M --> AM[git am]
  AM --> MC[commit recreated]
